ne;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Mã nguồn bị lỗi hiện tại</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"table\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-style:none;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\" width=\"651\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#12324a;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:2.25pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#ffffff;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>JAVA</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#f4f6f8;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:4.75pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; package com.rikkei.mcp;</span></span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; 