nt-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> để tắt hoàn toàn Banner khởi động của Spring Boot thông qua&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Banner.Mode.OFF</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bản vá cấu hình Logback (`src/main/resources/logback-spring.xml`):</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Viết tệp cấu hình Logback hoàn chỉnh để chuyển hướng toàn bộ các log mức độ&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">INFO</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400